            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.35.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "35.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.12+DEU.5.13+DEU.5.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 5.12-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nkolong'i ile easi esiai; kake ore te nkolong e naapishana naa enkolong e sabato naitirring'ae aayeng'iyeng'a, eumata sinyati, miasiasa intae esiaai ina olong. Sabato ina to Laitoriani tiatua imanyishoreitin inyi pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulo ninche lelo siruai oogeluno to Laitoriani, nena umat naasinya, naa ninche ipuopuo aalimu aaibalunye too nkatitin enye naategelakaki ninche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Osirua le ngiroroto o mukateni neitu eisuishieki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
