          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 23.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.9+DEU.16.10+DEU.16.11+DEU.16.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 16.9-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ninkenikene intae ebaiki ina akenya etulusoyie sabato, ebaiki ina akenya apa niyautua orridati lo lasar oyuki wikii naapishana naalulung'a, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aaikenu nkolong'i onom ometabaiki ina akenya nasuju sabato e naapishana; nitumutumu taa aaitarasaki olasar leina tapa ng'ejuk Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyauu intae tiatua imanyishoritin inyi imukateni are pee eyuki, naaitobirunyeki irubat are tiatua e tomon e Efa, naa ine ntapa napuyiapui, naa kepeji ninche tenebo enkisuijoi, anaa ilng'anayio le dukuya ooishori Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nintarasaa intae tenebo nena mukateni ilkuoo le kerra oopishana lo lari obo lemeeta ntioot, o loti oing'oni obo, olmeregeshi oare, neaku ninche olasar opejokini te nkima Olaitoriani tenebo olasar lenye le ntapa o lasarri lenye ooki, anaa olasar opejori, esong'ouna narropil to Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipolososo ositima obo le kine metaa olasar le ng'oki, o lkuoo oare le kerra lo lari obo anaa lasarri le seriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyuk olapolosani ninche tenebo ina mukate oo lng'anayio le dukuya anaa olasar oyuki te dukuya o Laitoriani, tenebo lelo kuoo oare le kerra; neaku ninche sinyat to Laitoriani tenkaraki olapolosani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
