                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Naa tenisampumpu intae nkurman inyi nimisampumpu aaitabaiki nkiting'ot, nimisotisoto ina kurma nitudung'o te nkisampuare entung'uai ninche te nkaraki olaisinani o lomoni: Ara nanu Olaitoriani Enkai inyi.”",
