                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejoki Olaitoriani Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore te nkolong e tomon eilo apa liopishana naa enkolong o lning'o lo sotua naa keaku te intae enkata e umata sinyati, naa ieniene ate aaitupukoo nintarasakiki Olaitoriani olasar opejori tenkima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimiaasiasa esiaai teina olong; amu enkolong o lning'o lo sotua, pee eitobiri olning'o lo sotua te nkaraki intae te dukuya Olaitoriani Enkai inyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore oltung'ani lemeen kewan aitupukoo teina olong neitayuni aaiwuang'ie too ltung'ana lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore oloba anaa oloas esiaai teina olong, ore ilo tung'ani naidaikie aiwuang'ie tiatua iltung'ana lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miasiasa intae esiai: Keaku ina enkitanapata ntarasi tiatua iishoritin too manyishoritin inyi pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keaku te intae enkolong naeng'ieng'ae aaitirring'a nieniene ate aaitupukoo. Ore te nkolong e naaudo o lapa eiteru teipa, eiteru te nteipa ometabaiki teipa imbung'ubung'u intae sabato inyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
